* CABSRT02 - SORT EDITED USAGE AHEAD OF OCN/BAN VALIDATION
* MVT SORT/MERGE CONTROL CARD.  SORTS TELCABS.CABS.USAGE.EDITED
* INTO OCN/BAN/SEQ ORDER SO CABING02 CAN CACHE OCN LOOKUPS
* ACROSS A CONTIGUOUS RUN OF THE SAME OCN (SEE THE V1.30 1998
* NOTE IN CABING02 - THE CACHE ONLY HELPS IF THE INPUT ARRIVES
* IN THIS ORDER).
*
* THE FATAL EDIT-STATUS RULE HAS LEFT THIS CARD.  RECORDS WHOSE
* EDIT STATUS BYTE AT COLUMN 30 IS 6 THROUGH 9 ARE NOW DELETED
* BY THE E15 EXIT CABSXEDT.  A FATAL RECORD HAS ALREADY BEEN
* DIVERTED TO SUSPENSE BY CABING01 AND MUST NOT BE VALIDATED A
* SECOND TIME - IF IT WERE, CABING02 WOULD SUSPEND THE SAME
* RECORD AGAIN AND THE CONTROL TOTALS WOULD NOT BALANCE.
*
* EQUAL KEY HANDLING IS NOT CODED.  THE KEY CARRIES THE SEQUENCE
* NUMBER, SO THERE IS NO EQUAL KEY ORDER TO GUARANTEE.
*
* THE OMITTED RANGE IS NO LONGER READABLE FROM THIS CARD.
 SORT FIELDS=(5,4,CH,A,9,13,CH,A,22,9,CH,A)
 RECORD TYPE=F,LENGTH=(200)
 MODS E15=(CABSXEDT,4096,SORTEXIT,N)
 END
